   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I am developing clickstream user tracking for one of my apps and writing the final data with onSessionEnded...but it seems like only session values are accessible inside of onSessionEnded...how can I access all the variables from within onSessionEnded?<br><br>Here is the tracking code:<br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">observeEvent</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">session$onSessionEnded</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    userTracking$endTime</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sys</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">time</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    userTracking$totalTime</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">difftime</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">userTracking$endTime</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">userTracking$startTime</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">units</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;mins&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    userTracking$user</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ifelse</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">is</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">null</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">session$user</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;unauthenticated&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">session$user</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    userTracking$Restricted</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">logical</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">grep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;shiny_ru&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">groups</span><span style=\"color:#660\">())))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    userTracking$homeSearch</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">userTime$homeSearch<br>    userTracking$homeTrends</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">userTime$homeTrends<br>    userTracking$topicModeling</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">userTime$topicModeling<br>    userTracking$trends</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">userTime$trends<br>    userTracking$about</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">userTime$about<br>    write</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">table</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">userTracking</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> file </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;userTracking.txt&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">append </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> row</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">names </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">names </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sep </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;|&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span></div></code></div>all the &quot;userTime$&quot; reactiveValues are zero when the table is written even though the app code updates them every second.<br><br>How can I pass these time values to onSessionEnded so they can be logged appropriately?<br><br></div>"
    ]
   ]
